<hr color="#FF0000" width=90%>
<p><br><a name=a1><b><font color="#FB5C46" face=" Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size=3>
What are the benefits given to me if I am a registered user?</font></b></a><br> 
If you are a registered user, you will have the following benefits:-<br>
<ul type="circle">
<li>View various jobs online & apply for them online with a single click</li>
<li>Create an account(profile)</li>
<li>Update your unique account</li>
<li>Submit your personalised C.V.(either in a file form or created online)</li>
</ul>
</p><br>
<b><a href="#top">Top </a></b><br>
<b><a name=a2><font color="#FB5C46" face=" Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size=3>
	What are the benefits for a registered employer/provider?</font></a></b><br>
<br>As a registered provider, you will have the convenience of an online job search outlet for your company.
After a payment of a little fee, you can use many features of this site to meet and improve your HR department goals/requirements.<br>
Followng are some of the features provided by this website<br>
<ul type="circle">
<li>Search for employees with multiple criteria (By experience ,age ,specialisation ,educational qualification ,
<br>or even a combination of these)</li>
<li>Search for additional personnel (through references)</li>
<li>View Profiles posted by registered users</li>
<li>Add, Modify and Delete the jobs posted by You!</li>
</ul>
<b><a href="#top" >Top </a></b><br><a name=a3><b><font color="#FB5C46" face=" Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size=3>
As a user, how should I fill up my Registration Form?</font></b></a><br>
While registering as a user, you'll have to fill up a form containing the following details :-
<ul type="circle"><table cellpadding="3">
<th bgcolor="#6600FF"><font color="#FFFFFF">Choice name</font></th>
<th bgcolor="#6600FF"><font color="#FFFFFF">Choice information</font></th>
<tr><td><li>Name:</li></td><td>Enter your full name</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Age:</li></td><td>Enter age in numbers</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Address:</li></td><td>Enter the contact address</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Phone No:</li></td><td>Enter a contact ph.number</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>E-mail id:</li></td><td>Enter your e-mail id</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Gradation:</li></td><td>Select an option</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Post Graduation:</li></td><td>Select an option</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Technology:</li></td><td>Enter your specialisation skill(eg,Retail,.NET,Criminal,Income Tax,etc) of your field.</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>User ID:</li></td><td>Enter a unique id (Remember that you will log in with this id, not your name)</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Password:</li></td><td>Enter a password for login</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Retype Password:</li></td><td>Retype the password given above to confirm the password.</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Hint Question:</li></td><td>Enter a hint question that will be asked if you enter a wrong password.</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Hint Answer:</li></td><td>Enter an answer for your Hint Question.</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>Reference:</li></td><td>Enter name of a reference.</td></tr>
<tr><td><li>E-mail id:</li></td><td>Enter his/her e-mail id.</td></tr>
</table></ul>
<br>
<b><a href="#top">Top </a></b><br>
<br><a name=a4><b><font color="#FB5C46" face=" Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size=3>
How should I register as a corporate user?</font></b></a><br> 
If you are a corporate/recruiter, you will have to submit an e-mail to our website at :-<br><br>
<a href="mailto:contact@cooljobs.com">Our contact mailing address</a> .<br><br>
You will be contacted by us and will be required to send a predetermined amount of money (contains registration/ads/maintinence
 expenses). Such expenses will be one time only.<br><br>
The subsequent usage of this website however, is free of cost.
</p><br>
<b><a href="#top">Top </a></b><br><br>

<br><a name=a5><b><font color="#FB5C46" face=" Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size=3>
I am getting a null value before modifying my a/c details?</font></b></a><br> 
This is most likely, a problem related to our server. This happens whenever our database is out of service for any reason.<br>
Also such problems will occur while logging in as a valid user or even while requesting some data.<br>
To repair such problem, close your browser and again log on to our website. If the problem still arises, kindly mail us at
our <a href="mailto:error@cooljobs.com">error reporting</a> e-mail address.
<br><br>
